# Editor Data Flow

For every data section:

- load the authoritative JSON into processed and raw Redux state;
- validate through SharedLibrary and display structured errors;
- preserve raw state after every save;
- include the file in external-change watching;
- normalize Windows and POSIX paths before comparison;
- save atomically through the restricted main-process API;
- add reducer/save/watch regression tests.

Do not add section-specific validation that competes with SharedLibrary or the
shared content registry.
